  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 102.01 Hazardous Waste Definitions in Federal Law",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 102.01 Hazardous Waste Definitions in Federal Law. Where federal provisions are adopted by reference, terms used shall be as defined in federal law unless otherwise specified in these rules.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100) #12343, eff 8-14-17",
